---
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Billy Ready"
  description="Meet Billy Ready, a Mississippi pastor, Christian counselor, author, and songwriter sharing Christ-centered music and biblical encouragement."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About Billy"
    title="One calling, expressed in many ways."
    intro="Mississippi pastor, Christian counselor, author, and songwriter—each role serving one purpose: pointing people to the faithfulness of God."
  />

  <section class="section page-shell about-story">
    <div class="roles-stacked reveal" aria-label="Billy Ready’s roles">
      <span>Pastor.</span>
      <span>Christian Counselor.</span>
      <span>Author.</span>
      <span>Songwriter.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="body-copy reveal">
      <p class="lead">
        For decades, God has allowed Billy to serve people through pastoral ministry, Christian counseling, writing, and music.
      </p>
      <p>
        Although those ministries may appear different, they share one purpose: helping people discover God’s faithfulness in every season of life.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every song he writes, every devotional he publishes, and every message he shares flows from a desire to glorify Christ and encourage His people.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mission-section">
    <div class="page-shell reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Ministry mission</p>
      <p class="mission-statement">
        Billy Ready Music exists to encourage people with the hope of Jesus Christ through <em>biblically faithful songs, honest stories,</em> and <em>Christ-centered ministry.</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section page-shell faith-layout">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Statement of faith</p>
      <h2>Built upon God’s Word and the saving grace of Jesus Christ.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="body-copy reveal">
      <p>
        I believe the Bible is God’s inspired and trustworthy Word, revealing His character, His plan of redemption, and His will for our lives.
      </p>
      <p>
        I believe Jesus Christ is the Son of God, who lived a sinless life, died for our sins, rose victorious over death, and offers eternal life to all who trust Him.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether through counseling, teaching, writing, or songwriting, my desire is to glorify God, encourage believers, and faithfully proclaim the hope found in Christ alone.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
